### Simple example with JSON response
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "context": {
    "name": "Ada"
  }
}

### Simple example with HTML response
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render
Accept: text/html
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "context": {
    "name": "Ada"
  }
}
